    <unit id="44" name="PageDescription">
      <segment>
        <source>Form coordinates fields, validation rules, submit/reset actions, and reusable form item controls for structured data entry workflows.</source>
        <target state="translated">Form 用於協調字段、校驗規則、提交/重置動作以及可複用表單項控件，適合結構化數據錄入場景。</target>
